@WebAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Create user
POST {{WebAPI_HostAddress}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "anna", "password": "1234" }

### Get users (filter)
GET {{WebAPI_HostAddress}}/users?userName=an

### Create post
POST {{WebAPI_HostAddress}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Hello world", "body": "My first post", "userId": 1 }

### Get posts (filters)
GET {{WebAPI_HostAddress}}/posts?title=hello&userName=anna

### Get single post with comments
GET {{WebAPI_HostAddress}}/posts/1?includeComments=true

### Create comment
POST {{WebAPI_HostAddress}}/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "body": "Nice post!", "userId": 1, "postId": 1 }

### Get comments for a post
GET {{WebAPI_HostAddress}}/posts/1/comments

### Get comments (filters)
GET {{WebAPI_HostAddress}}/comments?userName=anna&postId=1

### Update post
PUT {{WebAPI_HostAddress}}/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Hello again", "body": "Edited" }

### Delete comment
DELETE {{WebAPI_HostAddress}}/comments/1